{"compatibility":"minor","safety_note_md":"# SafeStan Safety Note

Compatibility: minor.

Protected data: `yt`.

Generated files: `model_safe.stan`, `data_safe.json`.

Changes: reordered the model block so each parameter is given its built-in prior before any later use. Vectorized the group prior from indexed loop statements to `ag ~ multi_normal(...)`, and vectorized the protected data observation to the top-level statement `yt ~ multi_normal(...)`.

The original data likelihood used `yt[i, 2]` inside the mean for `yt[i]` before the observation statement. This was rewritten algebraically as the equivalent marginal bivariate normal for `(yt[i, 1], yt[i, 2])`: the residual transform `(yt1, yt2) -> (yt1 - b * yt2, yt2)` has unit Jacobian, so the corresponding transformed mean and covariance preserve the same log density without reading protected `yt` before scoring it.

No data fields were added or changed.
","model_safe_stan":"data {
  int<lower=0> J;
  int<lower=0> N;
  array[N] int<lower=1, upper=J> siteset;
  array[N] vector[2] yt;
  vector[N] z;
}
parameters {
  array[J] vector[2] ag;
  real b;
  real d;
  real<lower=-1, upper=1> rho_ag;
  real<lower=-1, upper=1> rho_yt;
  vector[2] mu_ag;
  real<lower=0, upper=100> sigma_a;
  real<lower=0, upper=100> sigma_g;
  real<lower=0, upper=100> sigma_t;
  real<lower=0, upper=100> sigma_y;
}
model {
  vector[J] a;
  vector[J] g;
  matrix[2, 2] Sigma_ag;
  matrix[2, 2] Sigma_yt;
  array[N] vector[2] yt_hat;
  real cov_yt_resid;
  real var_t;

  // data level
  sigma_y ~ uniform(0, 100);
  sigma_t ~ uniform(0, 100);
  rho_yt ~ uniform(-1, 1);
  d ~ normal(0, 31.6);
  b ~ normal(0, 31.6);

  // group level
  sigma_a ~ uniform(0, 100);
  sigma_g ~ uniform(0, 100);
  rho_ag ~ uniform(-1, 1);
  mu_ag ~ normal(0, 31.6);

  Sigma_ag[1, 1] = pow(sigma_a, 2);
  Sigma_ag[2, 2] = pow(sigma_g, 2);
  Sigma_ag[1, 2] = rho_ag * sigma_a * sigma_g;
  Sigma_ag[2, 1] = Sigma_ag[1, 2];

  ag ~ multi_normal(mu_ag, Sigma_ag);

  for (j in 1 : J) {
    a[j] = ag[j, 1];
    g[j] = ag[j, 2];
  }

  cov_yt_resid = rho_yt * sigma_y * sigma_t;
  var_t = pow(sigma_t, 2);
  Sigma_yt[1, 1] = pow(sigma_y, 2) + 2 * b * cov_yt_resid
                    + pow(b, 2) * var_t;
  Sigma_yt[2, 2] = var_t;
  Sigma_yt[1, 2] = cov_yt_resid + b * var_t;
  Sigma_yt[2, 1] = Sigma_yt[1, 2];

  for (i in 1 : N) {
    yt_hat[i, 2] = g[siteset[i]] + d * z[i];
    yt_hat[i, 1] = a[siteset[i]] + b * yt_hat[i, 2];
  }

  yt ~ multi_normal(yt_hat, Sigma_yt);
}
